From 5488972fcf95eaabde2bd97d578749929aace983 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>
Date: Fri, 13 Nov 2026 18:02:49 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] Wait for LocalDevVPN's tunnel before Refresh All Apps

The automation of Shortcuts that renews Cartouche every night now runs
LocalDevVPN's own action, Enable LocalDevVPN, just before Cartouche's
Refresh All Apps: the player no longer has to leave LocalDevVPN
connected all day. That action starts the tunnel and returns before it
is up, and the built-in SideStore, which reaches the iPhone through the
tunnel as it starts, would fail. Refresh All Apps first waits for the
tunnel, 15 seconds at most, and at once when it is up
(launcher/SideStoreSupport/CartoucheTunnelWait.swift).

Cartouche's own Renew now goes through performIntentRefresh without
this wait: the launcher has LocalDevVPN connect before it
(launcher/Sources/CartoucheLocalDevVPN.swift).

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01MzPJotAD9o4mmxoc6uEwVp
---
 SideStoreSupport/SideStore.swift | 4 ++++
 1 file changed, 4 insertions(+)

diff --git a/SideStoreSupport/SideStore.swift b/SideStoreSupport/SideStore.swift
index d92d4a9..e5d8d56 100644
--- a/SideStoreSupport/SideStore.swift
+++ b/SideStoreSupport/SideStore.swift
@@ -66,6 +66,10 @@ public struct RefreshAllAppsIntent: AppIntent, CustomIntentMigratedAppIntent, Pr
     
     public func perform() async throws -> some IntentResult & ProvidesDialog
     {
+        // Cartouche: LocalDevVPN's Enable action, just before this one in
+        // the automation that renews Cartouche every night, returns before
+        // its tunnel is up (CartoucheTunnelWait).
+        await CartoucheTunnelWait.waitForLocalDevVPN()
         try await performIntentRefresh(identifier: "RefreshAllIntent", mangledTypeName: "9SideStore20RefreshAllAppsIntentV", intentProgress: progress)
         return .result(dialog: "All apps have been refreshed.")
     }
